constraints:
1 ≤ Number of Nodes ≤ 10^{6}
1 ≤ Value of each node ≤ 10^{6}

expected time complexity: O(N), N = number of Nodes
expected auxiliary space: O(N), N = number of Nodes

standard_solution_code:
class Solution:

	def sortedListToBST(self, head):
		temp = head
		arr = []
		while temp:
			arr.append(temp.data)
			temp = temp.next

		def build(arr, start, end):
			if start > end:
				return None
			if (start + end) % 2 == 0:
				mid = (start + end) // 2
			else:
				mid = (start + end) // 2 + 1
			node = TNode(arr[mid])
			node.left = build(arr, start, mid - 1)
			node.right = build(arr, mid + 1, end)
			return node
		return build(arr, 0, len(arr) - 1)
